    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41mc-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(Penalty: 2,000 penalty units.)",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits breach of consent.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and (b) the act or omission breaches a condition of a consent; and (c) the act or omission has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person."
    },
