      "cml:operator": "Temporal overlap",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person, by any means, advertises a medical device as being for a purpose; and (b) the device is of a kind included in the Register; and (c) the purpose is not a purpose accepted in relation to that inclusion."
    },
