      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the supply is not in accordance with the authority; or the supply is not in accordance with the conditions to which the authority is subject; or the supply is not in accordance with regulations made for the purpose of subsection 41HC(5).",
      "cml:confidence": {
