        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A power conferred on an issuing officer by this Part is conferred on the issuing officer: (a) in a personal capacity; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-51c-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
