      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.348",
      "skos:note": "If a jury acquits a person of an offence against a provision listed in column 2 of an item in the following table, but is satisfied beyond reasonable doubt of facts that prove that the person is guilty of the offence listed in column 3 of that item, the jury may convict the person of the offence listed in column 3 of that item.",
