      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) a person holds a licence or a permission to import or export therapeutic goods; and (b) the person engages in conduct; and (c) the conduct breaches a condition or a requirement to which the licence or permission is subject under the regulations;"
    },
